# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
#  CerviniaLive - what never belongs in the repository
#
#  This file used to be called "gitignore", without the dot. Git does not
#  know that name, so for its whole life it did nothing: node_modules/ sat
#  in the working tree as untracked, and every scraper run had to work
#  around it.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------

# Installed by "npm install" on every Actions run. Thousands of files,
# none of them ours.
node_modules/

# Logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*

# Things that must stay on your computer and nowhere else. Listing them
# here is a second lock on the door, behind the upload script's own
# neverUpload list: if a file is named here, "git add ." cannot sweep it
# in by accident.
push-secrets.txt
instructors-private.json
.env
.env.*
*.pem

# Leftovers from Windows, macOS and editors
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
*~
